    "statement": "M004 defines the zero-inclusive algebraic direct lift and the strictly positive active recurrent law. Provenance fixes the parent/child, ancestor, sibling and lapse support; the exact M003 scalar is transported unchanged. CanonicalM004Closure consumes CanonicalM003Closure directly and supplies the immutable, representative-independent instruction handoff. C008 alone applies the instruction.",
