      "owns the immutable provenance-supported direct scalar lift",
      "owns the distinction between zero-inclusive algebraic lift and strictly positive active C005 birth domain",
      "consumes response existence, universal PositiveSteering, and the active response-domain witness exclusively through CanonicalM003Closure",
      "keeps the zero-lapse theorem as boundary information without treating zero as a reachable active birth",
      "makes explicit that C004/C018 select the slot while response controls weights and lapse only",
      "introduces no rank, asymmetry, node-load scalar, nonlinear mode, backreaction coefficient, baseline, attenuation, clipping, fallback, or second newborn scalar",
      "does not mutate record/live state; it supplies the immutable semantic handoff consumed by C008"
    ]
